- Every pinch scenario stays green: f_batch2, k_pinch_gate, p_power, v_controller_actions, y_all_screens, z_4_erase_zoom_rotate, y_pagesize_2_back, z_a_precise_other_size.

implementation_steps.detail:
- Runner commands through touchgest on a virtual clock:
  - 'finger ID down|move|up X Y [MAJOR] [TOOL]', grouped into a frame until 'frame [MS]' (default 13 ms);
  - 'swipe N X Y DX DY [STEPS] [SEP] [LANDGAP]';
  - 'tapn N X Y [SEP] [MS]';
  - 'pen hover' and 'pen leave' drive the pen context.
- Window emulation: Shift / Alt / Ctrl with the right button.
- Probes: touch.contacts, touch.class, touch.suppressed.
- The legacy tap, touch, drag touch and pinch commands are unchanged.
- SIM.md documents all of it.

