- The Library and the Pages view (pagesview_pointer 327-347) use it.
- If the lane fixing the Index keyboard lands first, adopt its helper and only extract it.
- Add the keyboard.draws probe.

- touchgest:
  - commit classification: ZOOM, PAN with zoom held, SWIPE, TAP; per-axis scrolls (taller or wider AND pinch_zoom on); edge bands 25 / 15 mm;
  - the swipe and tap gates, firing at the first lift;
  - IN_PINCH_MOVE.value 0/1/2/3. pinch() skips its own dead zone for 1 and 2, and keeps today's logic for 0;
  - IN_GESTURE after PINCH_END; suppression until all lift;
  - resting contacts plus 'hand moved'; the conservative pen rule; size guards (log-only until the log is read).
- The editor pushes its view context from view_clamp, sheet changes and settings.
- New src/gesturemap.c: built-in defaults and the overlay read of gestures.ini (writing comes in step 18). Defaults: touch.2.down=pages, up=links, left=next-page, right=previous-page.
- editor_gesture with the mirror rule, ignored while any keyboard is open. editor_shortcut_at(..., src): touch and pen never create a page.
- New names: 'links' (opens Find until step 9), 'go-to-page', 'go-back', 'link-areas', in a new Index group in library.c's existing tables. Consolidation comes in step 16.
- settings.ini 'gestures'. The rate-limited pen-near toast, the edge hint and hints bit 0 (the first-open tip).

implementation_steps.tests:
- test_touchgest, each threshold on both sides of its edge:
  - travel 19 / 21 mm;
  - angle 29 / 31 degrees;
  - landing 140 / 160 ms;
  - spread 0.55 / 0.65 of travel;
  - edge band 24 / 26 mm;
  - pen distance 35 / 45 mm;
  - finger ratio 1.9 / 2.1.
  Also: reversing cancels; a resting thumb is ignored; a moving palm rejects; value 0 legacy parity.
- test_gesturemap: overlay, '=nothing', refused and kept lines.
- Scenarios:
  - g_gest_1: upright, 2-down opens Pages and 2-up closes it; 2-left gives the next page; at the last page the toast and npages unchanged;
  - g_gest_2_zoomed: a mid-screen drag pans with editor.zoom unchanged; from the top band it opens Pages; at a scroll limit a drag pans nowhere and opens nothing;
  - g_gest_3_sideways: the same, plus the edge hint once;
  - g_gest_4_pen: a swipe 300 ms after the pen leaves, 60 mm away, works; at 20 mm, touch.reject is pen;
  - g_gest_5_pinch_off: swipes work, spreads do nothing;
  - g_gest_6_keyboard: a swipe during naming does nothing;
  - asleep: gestures are dropped.
- k_pinch_gate and every pinch scenario stay green.

