phases.owner_can_test:
Nothing new on screen, but you can test four things:
- The Index keyboard types without lag.
- A finger resting on a link no longer follows it when the pen comes near.
- Pinch zoom feels as before.
- After a long page render, taps still register. Touch is read during long work now.
Then run the 3-minute touch script in docs/KINDLE.md and send the log:
- 20 two-finger swipes each way;
- 10 two-finger taps;
- 5 three-finger taps;
- a page of writing with the palm resting;
- 10 swipes right after lifting the pen.
That log sets the gesture thresholds.
